message: "Please cite this dataset using the metadata below and preserve the original source credits described in the repository."
type: dataset
title: "Peak Country Northern Colorado Hail History Dataset, 2016–2025"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-11"
repository-code: "https://github.com/brandonmorrow365-netizen/peak-country-northern-colorado-hail-data"
url: "https://github.com/brandonmorrow365-netizen/peak-country-northern-colorado-hail-data/releases/tag/v1.0.0"
authors:
  - name: "Peak Country Auto Hail Repair & Paintless Dent Repair"
    website: "https://peakcountryhail.com/"
contact:
  - name: "Peak Country Auto Hail Repair & Paintless Dent Repair"
    email: "info@peakcountryhail.com"
    website: "https://peakcountryhail.com/"
abstract: >-
  A published historical compilation of 1,844 confirmed ground hail
  observation lineages in Weld and Larimer Counties, Colorado (2016–2025),
  with separate geographic subsets, descriptive statistics, figures and
  source provenance. Radar context is not ground confirmation. These data
  do not establish individual property hail damage or climatic trends.
keywords:
  - hail history
  - Northern Colorado
  - Weld County
  - Larimer County
  - Greeley
  - historical hail observations
  - meteorology
  - geospatial data
